<title>AUSTRALIA: RUGBY UNION-FRANCE BEAT ACT PRESIDENT'S XV 31-22.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FRANCE BEAT ACT PRESIDENT'S XV 31-22.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>France beat ACT President's XV 31-22 (halftime 19-15) in a rugby union tour match at Bruce Stadium on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>France - Tries: Jean-Luc Sadourny (2), Philippe Bernat-Sales, Abdel Benazzi, David Venditti. Conversions: Christophe Lamaison (3).</p>
<p>ACT President's XV - Tries: penalty try, David Knox, Ipolito Fenukitau. Conversions: David Knox (2). Penalty: David Knox.</p>
</text>
